OL,3,GNEWSATens of thousands of fridge
OL,4,Afreezers left at docks as household
OL,5,Acollections suspended
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,8,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said it was
OL,9,Fworking to manage the capacity
OL,10,Fshortages.
